  "statement": {
    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "Let Fn be a free group of finite rank n ⩾ 2. Is the group Inn Fn of inner\nautomorphisms of Fn a first-order definable subgroup of Aut Fn ? It is known that\nthe set of inner automorphisms induced by powers of primitive elements is definable\nin Aut Fn .                                                            V. Tolstykh",
